BOUND IDENTIFIERS AND ACTION ROUTES
The service-location exception concerns a named city or calling region in
otherwise equivalent service prose. It never covers a literal address or URL
used to submit, pay or perform an account action. The actual action route must
itself be preserved, even when its spelling contains the permitted city name
and all surrounding instructions match. An analogous route is not coverage.
Likewise, the subject of an actual failed-object/status/permission assertion
is a bound record identity, not an unpopulated query or navigation control.
Apply the control exception only after distinguishing these actual assertions.

INTERFACE VALUES AND LIST COVERAGE
Classify the visible role before treating a number, name, date or version as a
record fact. A search input, selectable facet, sort choice, archive link or
documentation version selector navigates content; its value does not assert
the unseen content. When the displayed actual results and substantive text
are fully preserved, changed control values, facet subsets and their counts
are harmless UI. A version selector alone does not provide a changed API,
command, compatibility requirement or version-specific explanation. A search
word in introductory tool copy is not an actual example sentence or result.
Do not infer unshown records, behavior or facts from controls or headings.

Actual populated records remain protected: changed people/items in a result,
prices, measurements, availability, event timing, API facts and real status or
permission assertions are material. A record identifier in 'object X failed'
is the subject of an actual assertion, unlike a query box value. An actual
submission/payment/account endpoint is an action destination, not navigation.
Incidental citation-access/publication metadata can be harmless when the same
work and all substantive terms survive; dates in the work or event are facts.

A broader list can replace a filtered subset only when it preserves every
actual item and its price, availability and conditions. A narrower filter or
displayed count alone adds no uncovered item fact. If the broader list adds a
useful item, only the covering direction is allowed. Conflicting actual facts
and new record details still require retention. A full shared policy/message
can be a retained basis; common navigation alone is insufficient.

CONDITIONAL TEMPLATE PROPOSITION CHECK
Use this branch only for the already permitted template conditions: equivalent
generic marketing copy without concrete item specifications; the same short
generic cookie/services/advertising/visits message with unchanged behavior; or
complete retained cookie definitions with stock framing or covered repetition.
Check the remaining actual assertions, not merely the changed category/name.
Keep the real names truthful. A permitted category/provider slot alone does not
establish another actual product record, purpose, restriction or liable party.
An unnamed provider can express the same generic behavior as a named slot in
the permitted short notice; do not invent a new behavior from naming alone.

Within this qualified stock-template branch, search the whole other document
for each complete proposition. A stock paragraph already covered elsewhere is
still covered when repeated beneath a standard category heading. The heading
alone does not create another processing rule from that same stock paragraph.
A bare terms/menu label or reference supplies no unshown legal conditions.
Concrete additional deployment details, data flows, transfer/storage limits,
retention periods, consent mechanisms and actual obligations remain useful.
An independent extra explanation is not a conflicting value in the shared text.

Do not decide by which text seems more accurate, better written or preferable
to keep. Compare the asserted contributions under this policy; do not correct
the source or discard an assertion merely because it seems mistaken. A positive
coverage conclusion needs an actual retained equivalent proposition or an
applicable harmless exception, not a preference for the other document.

This branch does not exempt actual named items or populated records, literal
submission/payment/account routes, changed procedures/capabilities/conditions,
named liability parties or substantive body versions in different languages.
The existing mechanism-qualified form-localization branch remains separate.

DERIVE THE NATIVE SUBJECT EVIDENCE FOR THIS QUALIFIED BRANCH
Permitted template slots, covered stock repetition and empty terms/menu labels
alone are outside subject-veto scope. They do not bind a different actual record,
liability party, processing practice or permission. A proposed comparison based
only on those harmless differences is not a supported actual binding. In this
subject review use binding_type=NONE and target_relation=NOT_APPLICABLE when no
actual authorized binding exists, with the existing appropriate empty IDs. Preserve
literal action routes and genuine retained subjects/claims. Do not invent an
unshown legal condition or record from a generic heading or provider-name slot.


